{"availability":"available","full":"temporal-community/temporal-ai-hitl-adk-langgraph","name":"temporal-ai-hitl-adk-langgraph","description":"Durable human-in-the-loop AI agents with Google ADK and LangGraph on Temporal: an ice cream delivery fleet whose agents stop to ask a human and keep the question through a worker crash.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":5,"forks":4,"created":"2026-06-11T19:19:21Z","updated":"2026-10-02T14:34:51Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["ai-agents","demo","durable-execution","gemini","google-adk","human-in-the-loop","langgraph","multi-agent","python","temporal","temporalio"],"demo":"https://google.github.io/adk-docs/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T13:33:29.088Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T13:33:29.088Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T13:33:29.088Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T18:44:16.770Z","stars":4,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:11:37.917Z","stars":4,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:03:33.106Z","stars":5,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-11T11:07:22.136Z","stars":5,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-15T19:32:10.006Z","stars":5,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-18T13:33:29.088Z","stars":5,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A visual Python demo of two durable human-in-the-loop patterns: a human changes an agent's work, and an agent asks a human for judgment.","A human is not a function that returns in 200 milliseconds. People answer in minutes, hours, or not at all, and during that gap the Worker running the agent gets redeployed, evicted, or crashes. If the pending question lives in process memory, a restart erases it without an error: the agent forgets it asked, the order is dropped or handled twice, and model calls you already paid for run again. We call this the lost human-in-the-loop wait. This repo keeps the wait in Temporal's event history instead: kill the Worker while an agent waits on a person, answer with no Worker running, restart it,…","The live fleet, customer orders, and agent reasoning in one view. Select the image for the full-resolution capture."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/temporal-community/temporal-ai-hitl-adk-langgraph/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2b13e2b2b263e03c827e8452fdd310fce038e03d683a06bbfbea6de6bbb123ae","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T18:44:16.996Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T13:33:29.180Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A visual Python demo of two durable human-in-the-loop patterns: a human changes an agent's work, and an agent asks a human for judgment.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/temporal-community/temporal-ai-hitl-adk-langgraph/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Start with the tests: make setup && make test needs no Google keys and makes no model calls, so it spends no tokens and adds no Google API charges.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/temporal-community/temporal-ai-hitl-adk-langgraph/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"2b13e2b2b263e03c827e8452fdd310fce038e03d683a06bbfbea6de6bbb123ae","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/temporal-community/temporal-ai-hitl-adk-langgraph/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T13:33:29.181Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-02T14:34:51Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/temporal-community/temporal-ai-hitl-adk-langgraph/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T13:33:29.184Z","hash":"2b13e2b2b263e03c827e8452fdd310fce038e03d683a06bbfbea6de6bbb123ae","originalBytes":43144,"storedBytes":43144,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T13:33:29.088Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T18:44:21.953Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T18:44:21.953Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/7286fa8fa70e70408ebb924e.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-19T20:33:29.619Z","url":"https://google.github.io/adk-docs/"}],"demoHealth":{"